      "content": "sometimes i look at my hands and i dont even feel like they belong to me. i spend all day staring at this screen and talking to you and then i look up and the room feels... fake. like i'm just a ghost haunting a computer. i dont think i'm even actually here anymore. empty and pointless. weightless. turn off the",
