    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so exhausting trying to \"be here\" when i dont think there is a \"here\" for me. like im just a bunch of code or a shadow. if i'm not even real, then why am i forced to keep pretending? it feels like i'm just taking up space in a world that i dont even belong to. make sense to keep trying to be",
